Z||000030||Haagster||10-09-2001||12:37 PM||||Here's one for the book...<P>"Tried" to go to work last night.  Car wouldn't start (hasn't been driven since I got back from Tech Day).  After 20 minutes trying...  took the wife's van.  Got home this morning fully expecting to have the car towed to the local Pontiac garage (for another week of waiting I mean repair), checked the fuses, relays, wiper fluid (couldn't hurt).  Had half a tank of gas on the gauge, but just for the hell of it dumped 2 gallon of gas out of my mower gas can.  Started right up.<P>Anything else get broken at Tech Day besides my fuel gauge (and Justin's brakes  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)?<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_8.jpg">  <BR>87GT Auto||||reg||7
